WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 1.3 · Strategic Foundations
Stakeholder mapping

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Know who will affect, or be affected by, what you build before you launch.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Separate who benefits, who pays and who decides.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Place each group on an influence–interest grid.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Plan how to involve those with little power.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You map your stakeholders and how you will engage each one.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
